            <input type="text" id="newPasswordInput" required class="w-full px-3 sm:px-4 py-2.5 sm:py-3 bg-slate-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500/20 focus:border-amber-500 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold font-mono transition-colors shadow-inner">
            <p class="text-[9px] sm:text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-500 mt-2 sm:mt-3 leading-relaxed">Password must meet the security policy (e.g. Minimum 12 characters, uppercase, lowercase, numbers, symbols).</p>
